         <subform name="Subform1" w="203.2mm" layout="tb">
            <draw w="203.2mm" h="10.010625in">
               <value>
                  <exData contentType="text/html">
                     <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">PURPOSE OF THIS FORM</p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">California State University, Fullerton (CSUF) offers access to AI-powered tools and services—such as TitanGPT, Adobe AI Assistant, and other educational AI platforms—to enhance learning and engagement. Students under the age of 18 must have parental or guardian consent to use these services.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">This form provides important information about these services and requests your authorization for your child to access them.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>Use of campus AI services is voluntary.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">DESCRIPTION OF AI SERVICES</p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Your child may be granted access to the following campus AI tools, subject to the terms and conditions associated with the use of each tool:</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>1. TitanGPT – A secure, university-hosted version of ChatGPT for academic and support use.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>2. Adobe AI Assistant – A creative and academic tool integrated into Adobe platforms.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>Other approved AI tools provided by CSUF to support learning, communication, and research.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">These services allow students to interact with AI-powered systems to receive support, generate content, and learn more effectively. All use is governed by CSUF policies.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">INFORMATION THAT MAY BE COLLECTED</p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">When using AI tools, students may input:</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>1.Class-related prompts or questions</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>2.Coursework and project details</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>3.Feedback or reflections related to assignments</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Students are instructed not to input sensitive personal information, such as:</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>1.Social security numbers</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>2.Health records</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>3.Financial information</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">BENEFITS AND RISKS</p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Benefits:</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>1.<span style="font-weight:normal">Enhanced academic support</span></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>2.Improved engagement and digital literacy</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>3.Access to tools aligned with real-world technologies</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Risks:</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>1.<span style="font-weight:normal">AI-generated responses may sometimes be inaccurate or inappropriate</span></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>2.Interactions may be logged for quality, safety, and security assurance</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>3.Minimal data handling risks under CSUF's secure usage policies</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">PARENTAL/GUARDIAN CONSENT</p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">By signing below, I acknowledge and agree to the following on behalf of my minor student listed below:</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>1.I have read and understand the information in this consent.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>2.I authorize my child to access and use AI tools provided by CSUF.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>3.I understand that all use is subject to university policies.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>4.I may revoke this consent at any time by contacting [Insert Department Email or Phone Number] in writing.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p></body>
                  </exData>
               </value>
